9|an instance async method cannot be in a struct \(the struct would be copied\); use a class or a static method
16|'await' can only be used inside an 'async' method \(mark it: async Task Metodo\(\)\)
19|an async method must return void, Task, or Task<T> \(not 'int'\)
27|an async method returning 'Task' cannot return a value \(use Task<T>\)
30|not all code paths return a value in 'FaltaReturn'
36|an async method cannot have 'ref' or 'out' parameters
45|cannot await a value of type 'int': it needs a GetAwaiter\(\) method \(like Task and Task<T>\)
46|'await' cannot be used in this position \(inside '\?\.' or '\?\?=', in the condition or increment of a 'for', in the condition of a 'do-while', or in a 'ref' reference\); store the result in a variable first: var x = await \.\.\.;
51|'await' cannot be used in a 'when' filter
54|'await' can only be used inside an 'async' lambda \(async \(\) => \.\.\.\)
55|not all of the lambda's code paths return a value
